    ($SATQ$aa2d36fe$SATQ$, $SATQ$c2d6ad1f-5e60-4cc7-a1e8-cc677271772b$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Geometry and Trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$S$SATQ$, $SATQ$S.D.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Circles$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 4, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">A circle in the <em>xy</em>-plane has the equation <math alttext="left parenthesis x minus 13 right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y minus k right parenthesis squared equals 64"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math>. Which of the following gives the center of the circle and its radius?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"dc69044b-6983-483a-b98a-742a950d94b4","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The center is at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 13 comma k right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and the radius is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math>.</p>"},{"id":"048f5b0e-5370-47fa-b725-3c75c75a5d4a","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The center is at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis k comma 13 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and the radius is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math>.</p>"},{"id":"79ea078f-06ca-4ae0-bd25-27a147e7c6b8","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The center is at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis k comma 13 right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and the radius is <math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math>.</p>"},{"id":"b72568f7-990f-4b5b-af90-4fd8abd0db49","content":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The center is at <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 13 comma k right parenthesis\"><mo>(</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and the radius is&nbsp;<math alttext=\"64\"><mn>64</mn>\n</math>.</p>"}]$S