<msup>
<mi>r</mi>
<mn>2</mn>
</msup>
<mo>=</mo>
<mn>64</mn>
</mrow>
</math> yields <math alttext="r equals plus or minus 8"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&plusmn;</mo><mn>8</mn></math>. Therefore, the center of the circle is at <math alttext="left parenthesis 13 comma k right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and the radius is <math alttext="8"><mn>8</mn>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This gives the center and radius of a circle with equation <math alttext="left parenthesis x minus k right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y minus 13 right parenthesis squared equals 64"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math>, not <math alttext="left parenthesis x minus 13 right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y minus k right parenthesis squared equals 64"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This gives&nbsp;the center and radius of a circle with equation <math alttext="left parenthesis x minus k right parenthesis squared plus left parenthesis y minus 13 right parenthesis squared equals 4,096"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4,096</mn>
